  dialogueText: '"Now you can answer that question yourself. In Ilokano, ''taga ___
    ak'' means ''I am from ___. ''

    The phrase ''taga'' introduces the place
    you come from, while the location changes depending on your answer. For example:
    ''taga Vigan ak.'
